msgstr "Тестов режим"

#: includes/admin/class-payments-admin.php:110
msgid "no real money; pay with Stripe's test card 4242 4242 4242 4242."
msgstr ""
"без реални пари; платете с тестовата карта на Stripe 4242 4242 4242 4242."

#: includes/admin/class-payments-admin.php:111
msgid "Live"
msgstr "Реален режим"

#: includes/admin/class-payments-admin.php:111
