#: includes/class-payments.php:876
#, php-format
msgid "Amount received: %s"
msgstr "Получена сума: %s"

#: includes/class-payments.php:879
msgid ""
"Please contact the guest: offer another room or dates (then confirm the "
"booking), or refund the payment in your Stripe account."
msgstr ""
"Моля, свържете се с госта: предложете друга стая или дати (след това "
